neo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aNaQtkWKdA4Q7kNvwHz92nD&_nc_oc=Adm2kHMP6NSnTNzJMHXa9JLg-NuO7h_rUJSfSfKkYmORkxhj0WKvQu2Cr3J2SiY_uSU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftFLX4gDEJUyhvvdL3aYa956wcWlOFzqH0km2dlF1XIoA&oe=699D89F4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DOIpGF3wOvgQ7kNvwGEwNhS&_nc_oc=AdmRx-1k6VA2HdDXRjZdVhBVj95PtrHuLB2t0dKCLFeBrAw1JdcTIwQ0Ccq2zSuNkVA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfszLG00dRqUk6D1uXSrYBNDxtw8DNwLuFrdXB571RRcEw&oe=699D8B56"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3mawh5w-6lAQ7kNvwE6vaZa&_nc_oc=Adkg4fcwBQT8OlOL6zyuaqwazvjiFyvMq2gMHjhWQ2Ir_2bAIoYFIaqLjI3xoK9tjQk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsTwIlel6om3fRg88lB08D6uPNQQaI2Cd_Ew41ao0ISIQ&oe=699DA077"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974472_629709421448022_713197402145434487_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_